---
alwaysApply: true
---

Always read:
- PROJECT_STATUS.md
- BACKEND_ARCHITECTURE.md

before implementation.

Core Rules:
- no mock data
- no business logic inside API routes
- service-layer architecture only
- worker-first async systems
- preserve Silent Mode UI
- no uncontrolled refactors
- no deleting working systems
- implement one backend slice only
- preserve backward compatibility
- use structured errors
- use audit logs for publish actions
- use idempotent job execution
- keep API routes thin
- prefer additive migrations
- preserve existing UI behavior

Implementation Rules:
- run npm run lint after changes
- run npm run build -- --webpack after changes
- final response only
- no progress commentary
- no giant rewrites
- no unrelated file edits

Architecture Rules:
- routes are orchestration only
- business logic belongs in lib/server/*
- providers belong in lib/providers/*
- queues/workers own retries
- services own validation and lifecycle logic
- UI must not directly own backend logic

Product Direction:
Build:
- AI Social Growth Operating System
- creator-first SaaS
- viral intelligence platform

Do NOT build:
- generic scheduler clone
- enterprise dashboard clone
- mock/demo systems
